<section id="bbs012" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Three headline numbers in a divided row under one working title, each with a label and a one-line note; one short figure each so the display type holds, a longer figure taking the smaller display size.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="DFXFlLr-f8"><h2>The quarter in numbers</h2><grid vertical-sizing="fill" divider="sm neutral-border"><grid-item colspan="20" vertical-align="center" id="KQV2IzutBA"><display size="md">+18%</display><h4>Revenue against plan</h4><p>Ahead in every region except the south, which the warehouse move disrupted.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20" vertical-align="center" id="2BJ98yEHL3"><display size="md">68%</display><h4>Orders from repeat customers</h4><p>Up from 54 percent a year ago, driven by the standing-schedule program.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20" vertical-align="center" id="yYtS6iwYhr"><display size="md">41%</display><h4>New lines against launch target</h4><p>Both lines behind; training material ships before the autumn cycle.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>